repository-code: 'https://github.com/Ali-Rezaali/UC4D'
abstract: >-
  A multi-scale (10 m and ~926.6 m), multi-source
  spatiotemporal data cube framework for urban environmental
  studies, demonstrated for Tehran (Iran) and Singapore. The
  framework integrates Sentinel-1 SAR, Sentinel-2 optical,
  FABDEM topography, 3D urban morphology, VIIRS nighttime
  lights, WorldPop population density, and bias-corrected,
  downscaled ERA5/ERA5-Land atmospheric fields.
